<bold>Data S1:</bold> Supporting Information.</p></caption><media xlink:href="JNE-37-e70079-s001.docx"/></supplementary-material></sec></body><back><ack id="jne70079-sec-0014"><title>ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS</title><p>This activity was supported by the European Reference Network (ERN) on Rare Adult Solid Cancers (EURACAN). The authors acknowledge the contribution to this work of the Humanitas Multidisciplinary NET Group (collaborators: Alexia Bertuzzi, Laura Evangelista, Giuseppe Ferrillo, Alice Laffi, Elisabetta Lavezzi, Giuseppe Marulli, Gennaro Nappo, Cristina Ridolfi, Michele Pagnanelli, Vittorio Pedicini, Fabio Procopio, Marcello Rodari) and the Pederzoli Hospital Multidisciplinary Pancreas Cancer Group (collaborators: Laura Bignotto, Roberto Girelli, Gabriele Giannotti, Marco Toaiari, Elisa Bannone, Erica Pizzocaro). Open access funding provided by BIBLIOSAN. [Correction added on 25 September 2025, after first online publication: BIBLIOSAN 2023 funding statement has been added.]</p></ack><sec sec-type="data-availability" id="jne70079-sec-0018"><title>DATA AVAILABILITY STATEMENT</title><p>The data that support the findings of this study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.</p></sec><ref-list id="jne70079-bibl-0001" content-type="cited-references"><title>REFERENCES</title><ref id="jne70079-bib-0001"><label>1</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal" id="jne70079-cit-0001">
